From a284572f122c527c07f6359bcfbeaa15734a606a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:43:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 099/100] soc: mediatek: check pre-negotiation WMT version
 reads

Send chip HW and ROM reads once with exact replies, finite deadlines and
stop-on-first-error ordering. Retain resources and exclude all further
initialization.

Internal experiment archive; synthetic non-certifying author, no DCO. No
hardware result.
